140	    // [retryMessage] above): [Left] is unmapped; a [Right] is only ever
141	    // turned into a real [ChatInsight] when the backend's own `status`
142	    // is `'ready'` (RF08) — anything else (`generating`/`failed`/
143	    // `dismissed`), or a `'ready'` response with no non-blank `content`
